          {
            "title": "Example: Storing it in a variable",
            "id": 80361,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wyświetl wartość zwracaną w konsoli, wywołując funkcję z wartością <code>\"Jo\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sign_up\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(user)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  status = user + \" /><text value=\"&quot; signed up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sign_up(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"86\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Jo signed up\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>sign_up(\"Jo\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Return",
            "id": 80281,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co jest nie tak z tym kodem?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"wrong_answer\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;That's incorrect!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Słowo kluczowe <code>return</code> znajduje się po wartości zwracanej</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Z tym kodem nie ma nic nie tak</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Wartości tekstowej nie można zwrócić bez umieszczenia jej w zmiennej</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Słowo kluczowe <code>return</code> znajduje się po wartości zwracanej.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Który wiersz powinien zastąpić wiersz z wcięciem, aby funkcja zwracała ciąg znaków?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"wrong_answer\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;That's incorrect!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return \"That's incorrect!\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"That's incorrect!\" return</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(\"That's incorrect!\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return \"That's incorrect!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Any type",
            "id": 80389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wywołaj funkcję i przekaż jej wartość.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_area\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  width = \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" width * height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Rectangle area: \" /><text value=\"{get_area(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Rectangle area: 2600\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>get_area</code>, następnie <code>(</code>, a potem <code>100</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wywołaj funkcję wewnątrz f-stringa i przekaż jej wartość, aby kod wyświetlił <code>Rectangle area: 2600</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_area\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  width = \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" width * height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Rectangle area: \" /><text value=\"{get_area(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"height\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Rectangle area: 2600\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>get_area</code>, następnie <code>(</code>, <code>100</code> i na końcu <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
